<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<text>
<p>JOHANNESBURG, March 3 (Reuter) Foreigners were net buyers of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Feb 28  Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		6,388.81	  53,565.49</p>
<p>    - sales		    5,980.49	  50,352.72</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)  408.32	  3,212.77</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
